<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka's forex reserves $1.779 bln at end-March.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka's forex reserves $1.779 bln at end-March.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's foreign exchange reserve at end-March 1997 stood at $1.779 billion, down 8.2 percent from end-December last year, the Central bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Reserves fell $159 million since December when they were at $1.938 billion.</p>
<p>Comparitive figures for March 1996 were not available.</p>
</text>
